# Migration Safety

## Objective

Schema and data changes must be **reproducible, reversible, and safe** under production data.

> **If this project has no database surface:** apply the same principles to the nearest persistent equivalent (files, config, key-value stores, local caches) or skip.

## Requirements

- Use the project's migration tooling; one change per migration when practical.
- Test migrations on realistic data copies.
- Prefer additive changes; deprecate before remove.
- Document rollback steps.
- Never destructive change without backup and migration path.

